                "text": "My staff recently joined UnityPoint Health at ribbon cuttings for two PACE Senior Care centers!\n\nThese centers in Hiawatha and Waterloo will provide seniors with a wide range of services including doctor appointments, filling their prescriptions, and assisting with personal tasks like laundry and even transportation.\n\nThank you, @UnityPointNews, for your partnership in ensuring seniors throughout #IA02 have the resources and care they need!",
