                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, the House will vote on President Trump\u2019s first rescission package to codify DOGE cuts including:\n\u00a0\n\u274c $4 million to \u201csedentary migrants\u201d in Columbia\n\u00a0\n\u274c $500,000 for electric buses in Rwanda\n\u00a0\n\u274c $3 million to fund sexual reproductive health in Venezuela\u2026\n\u00a0\nAnd that\u2019s just scratching the surface! \n\u00a0\nAmericans deserve their hard-earned tax dollars to be respected, and we should leave no stone unturned to deliver these savings.",
